CredentialRegistryAccountListValidatorPolicy_configure
├── when parameters are empty
│   └── it should initialize with no requirements or sources
├── when parameters are valid
│   └── it should store the configured requirement and source
├── when multiple inputs are valid
│   └── it should store every configured requirement and source
├── when parameters are malformed
│   └── it should revert
├── when requirement minValidations is zero
│   └── it should revert
├── when requirement credential types are empty
│   └── it should revert
├── when requirement is duplicate
│   └── it should revert
└── when source is duplicate
    └── it should revert
